// purpose: Monitor Privilege User SSPR
// source: https://github.com/SlimKQL/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/9c838dc165ac602c525321c6f475e5c90f2fd7d2/Sentinel/Monitor%20Privilege%20User%20SSPR.kql
